hideOS: System → Updates, a page that shows the deployments hideupd
(os.hide.Update1) reports, updates from the channel and goes back to the
previous one, with the disk's protection and the system extensions;
`cosmic-settings updates` opens it. hideOS's own, so not sent upstream:
it talks to a hideOS service. Under page-about, which brings zbus; no new
crates, so the vendored Cargo.lock still builds it.

